  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding the evaluation of nominations to the WH List (2024-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The WH Fund sub-account for funding the evaluation of nominations by the Advisory Bodies was created in 2019 (Decision 43 COM 14). At its creation, it aimed at reducing the expenses from the World Heritage Fund for financing evaluation activities, thus potentially saving resources of the WH Fund for allocating them to conservation activities.
In 2023, the Committee decided to use up to 100% of the funds available in this sub-account to contribute to the financing of the nomination process, particularly the Preliminary Assessment requests to be processed by the World Heritage Centre, ICOMOS and IUCN, as from September 2023 (Decision 45 COM 15).</narrative>
  </description>
